etail.companycode = MasterAccountsLedger.companyCode and TransactionDetail.TrnAccount = MasterAccountsLedger.ledgerCode \r\n where TransactionDetail.TrnEffect = -1 and TransactionMain.TrnType = 'CONTRA' and TransactionMain.companycode = @companyCode and TransactionMain.yearcode=@yearCode and  \r\n TransactionMain.VchDate >= @dateFrom and TransactionMain.VchDate <= @dateTo \r\n ) as X order by TrnNo ";
